1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,486
Your syringe says one hundred units.

2
00:00:02,486 --> 00:00:04,791
Ever wondered what a unit actually is?

3
00:00:04,791 --> 00:00:09,518
One unit on a U-100 syringe is one hundredth of a milliliter.

4
00:00:09,518 --> 00:00:10,299
That's it.

5
00:00:10,299 --> 00:00:11,367
Ten units?

6
00:00:11,367 --> 00:00:13,307
Zero point one milliliter.

7
00:00:13,307 --> 00:00:17,226
Here's the catch: units measure volume, not peptide.

8
00:00:17,226 --> 00:00:21,171
How much peptide is in those units depends on your concentration.

9
00:00:21,171 --> 00:00:24,270
BuddyPept converts units to milligrams for you.

10
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:26,523
Free, at Buddy Pept dot com.

11
00:00:26,523 --> 00:00:28,125
That's day four of ten.

12
00:00:28,125 --> 00:00:31,210
Ten days of peptide math, one lesson a day.

13
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:32,682
The math doesn't lie.

14
00:00:32,682 --> 00:00:34,752
Follow so you don't miss day five.

15
